<title>USA: NYSE seat sold for $1.2 mln.</title>
<headline>NYSE seat sold for $1.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange (NYSE) said on Friday a seat had been sold for $1.2 million, down $85,000 from the last sale on December 30, 1996.</p>
<p>The current market is $1.125 million bid, $1.225 million offered.</p>
